[328.372481458,"o","──────────────────────────────────────────┤\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[22mWeights change often               \u001b[2m │ \u001b[22m                                                   \u001b[2m │\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[2m└─────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mHybrid pattern:\u001b[22m HRW at the \u001b[1mcoarse\u001b[22m tier (pick shard/cluster from tens of nodes); CH \u001b[1minside\u001b[22m each shard (thousands of\r\n   cache nodes, O(log N) lookups).\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;147;197;253mSummary matrix\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m┌────────────────┬───────────"]
